  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Assistance Unit for Support to Criminal Justice Reform in Ethiopia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this contract is to support the Government of Ethiopia in its efforts to reform the criminal justice system in Ethiopia through the provision of ongoing technical assistance, advice and support to key institutions involved in the reforms and to ensure increased access to justice for all.</narrative>
  </description>
